---
/**
 * The cost-of-change staircase from `/designed` 1.2, drawn as inline SVG so it
 * inherits the design tokens: correct in both colour schemes, no binary asset,
 * no JS. Deliberately unnumbered on both axes. It is a schematic of the
 * escalation described in the prose, not a measurement of anything, and the
 * caption says so. The three cost labels ARE the y axis: "an afternoon" then
 * "a tool" then "the qualification" is the whole argument.
 */
---

<svg
  class="stair"
  viewBox="0 0 660 300"
  role="img"
  aria-labelledby="stair-title stair-desc"
  preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"
>
  <title id="stair-title">The cost of a change rises as a staircase, not a line</title>
  <desc id="stair-desc">
    Three levels, each a step higher than the last. During concept work the same change costs an
    afternoon. After tooling it costs a tool. After qualification it costs the qualification too.
    Each rise happens at a gate, not gradually.
  </desc>

  <!-- gates: where the cost steps, drawn behind the trace -->
  <g stroke="var(--rule)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 4">
    <line x1="278" y1="42" x2="278" y2="236" />
    <line x1="460" y1="42" x2="460" y2="236" />
  </g>

  <!-- axes -->
  <g stroke="var(--rule-strong)" stroke-width="1">
    <line x1="96" y1="42" x2="96" y2="236" />
    <line x1="96" y1="236" x2="640" y2="236" />
  </g>

  <!-- the staircase: the last regime is the expensive one, so it carries the
       signal colour rather than a second explanatory label -->
  <g fill="none" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="square">
    <polyline points="96,206 278,206 278,150 460,150" stroke="var(--ink)" />
    <polyline points="460,150 460,80 640,80" stroke="var(--signal)" />
  </g>

  <!-- what the same change costs in each regime -->
  <g font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="15">
    <text x="106" y="194" fill="var(--ink)">an afternoon</text>
    <text x="288" y="138" fill="var(--ink)">a tool</text>
    <text x="470" y="68" fill="var(--signal)">the qualification</text>
  </g>

  <!-- the three regimes -->
  <g
    font-family="var(--font-mono)"
    font-size="11"
    letter-spacing="1.4"
    fill="var(--ink-muted)"
  >
    <text x="104" y="30">DURING CONCEPT</text>
    <text x="286" y="30">AFTER TOOLING</text>
    <text x="468" y="30">AFTER QUALIFICATION</text>
  </g>

  <text
    x="640"
    y="262"
    text-anchor="end"
    font-family="var(--font-mono)"
    font-size="11"
    letter-spacing="1.4"
    fill="var(--ink-muted)">PROGRAMME TIME →</text
  >
</svg>

<style>
  .stair {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 0.75rem;
  }
</style>
